Z||000005||fotofrank||12-20-2001||01:51 PM||||Things I haven't done:<BR>merker( marine engine) crank<BR>Overbore and better pistons<BR>new cam<BR>Things that I did:<BR>MSD6A Ignition<BR>MSD GMblaster coil<BR>K&N filter<BR>Hooker header<BR>Holley intake( discontinued)<BR>Holley TB<BR>Hi Flo cat<BR>V6 muffler<BR>Things to try:<BR>lower ratio rockers<BR>better valve springs.<BR>The engine red lines at about 5000RPM because the valves begin to float at that RPM.<BR>Good lock and keep us all informed.<BR>P.S. with my mods I got 104+ HP.<P>------------------<BR>Peace and Happiness<BR>Frank and his fotoflash, an '84 SE||||reg||10
