Z||000011||Mach10||12-20-2001||05:46 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by riceboyfiero:<BR><B>well im really upset i cant get the power or rpms that i want but thanks for all the help!!!! you guys are awsome and plus im gonna need all the help i can get from you when i purchase this 86 gt with a 4.3l with auto!!!!!!!!!!!!! for 2 g's!!!!!!!!! thank you JESUS!!!!!!!! how are these engines in the car...dont know what tranny just said 3 speed with od...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> they wont pick up the phone!! grrr</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>4.3?!?? That's a 90* motor if I'm not mistaken. The 3800SC will drop right in there, if that's the case... Just have to funk with the wiring!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||6
